# =============================================================
#  Transkription_Notes_Pipeline - vocabulary.py.example
#  Domain vocabulary for whisperx initial_prompt.
#  Merged from Audio_Transkription_Notes_Pipeline and
#  Video_Transkription_Notes_Pipeline (superset of both).
#
#  Words and phrases listed here bias the Whisper decoder towards
#  correct spelling and recognition of technical terms without
#  any retraining.
#
#  How to use:
#    Copy this file to vocabulary.py and extend with your own terms.
#    - Add terms to the relevant section below.
#    - Acronyms: list the acronym AND its expansion (Whisper may hear either).
#    - Instrument model numbers: include spaces and hyphens as spoken.
#    - Multi-word phrases are more powerful than single words.
#    - Keep the total prompt under ~200 words; longer prompts give
#      diminishing returns and can be truncated (see build_initial_prompt).
#
#  Language: the pipeline picks VOCAB_EN or VOCAB_DE automatically
#  based on the detected/selected transcription language.
# =============================================================

